@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:LSF_BINDIR
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:LsfEnvironment ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Directory where LSF user commands are installed." .

hpc:LSF_ENVDIR
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:LsfEnvironment ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Directory containing the lsf.conf file." .


This ontology fragment defines two object properties, `hpc:LSF_BINDIR` and `hpc:LSF_ENVDIR`, which represent the LSF BINDIR and LSF ENVDIR environment variables, respectively. Both properties are used to describe the LSF environment and have a domain of `hpc:LSF_Environment` and a range of `xsd:string`.
